.com/@dcard.tw/post/De1S2cQj3j3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨財富自由了但不敢跟爸媽講✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多財富自由的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-23T10:00:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DezJgpfCMz3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DezJgpfCMz3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原po跟前男友買房吵到分手\n想問問大家想法><\n\n原本這段戀情主要追求陪伴\n沒有一定要生小孩，拼經濟\n兩個人丁克舒服生活即可\n但是交往到結婚才發現還是有現實面要考量\n\n男生爸媽花了頭期款\n但貸款八成要我們自己負擔\n但是男生爸媽堅持房子要登記男生的名字\n而且要求我要繳貸款\n\n這合理嗎？？？","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:00:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":26,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DezJiUMCMg8","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DezJiUMCMg8","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"為了房子的事情抹去前面兩年很甜蜜的感情？\n原文來自➡️ 跟前男友買房吵到分手，問大家想法⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情主題的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-22T14:01:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"De4JQvfFA7N","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De4JQvfFA7N","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Google 揭露 3 大新型詐騙手法：開了雙重驗證，假登入頁仍可能轉手攔截驗證結果！行事曆、雲端文件通知與 QR Code 也藏陷阱。有哪些日常習慣能減少風險？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-24T12:34:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4JRQCFP_G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De4JRQCFP_G","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-24T12:34:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De30jzVlJ-O","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De30jzVlJ-O","username":"kocpc","