rst_seen":"2026-10-24T15:48:13+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De22e_rk_x_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De22e_rk_x_","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-24T00:31:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T09:15:13+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De22eXrE_Wy","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De22eXrE_Wy","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Mac 上的 Windows 11 虛擬機也有 DirectX 加速了！UTM 5.0 加入 DX11／12 與快照功能，但驅動仍是實驗性、遊戲相容有限；DX12 需 D3DMetal 可用，Apple Silicon 也要 Rosetta。升級前還有哪些事要先留意？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-24T00:31:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T09:15:13+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De1kmQYlCBq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De1kmQYlCBq","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-23T12:36:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De1kln-lFc2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De1kln-lFc2","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"YouTube 首頁不只猜你喜歡，也能用文字描述想看的內容，建立持續更新的自訂推薦串。現在限美國13歲以上、英語介面，須登入並開啟觀看與搜尋紀錄，平板尚不支援；免費最多3組、Premium 8組。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-23T12:35:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De1iYbsCiS0","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De1iYbsCiS0","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"GPU都用來做這些了😅","timestamp":"2026-10-23T12:17:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":66,"replies":1,"reposts":4,"shares":19},"score":80,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De1P0CrFPGc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De1P0CrFPGc","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-23T09:34:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De1PqbpFFfJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De1PqbpFFfJ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Google Meet 語音翻譯擴展至63種語言，中文、廣東話也在內，能自動辨識發言再翻成你想聽的語言。功能分批推出，主辦者須有合格方案；每場90分鐘，指定高階方案可到8小時。有哪些限制要先看？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-23T09:33:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De07AILFL0A","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De07AILFL0A","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:32:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De06_h_FNfN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De06_h_FNfN","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Google 要讓 App 更難在背景改通訊錄，一般新增、編輯將改走系統編輯器。但不是升級就全面封鎖：新特殊權限預計2026年底提供，直接寫入限制是2027年後續版本，且只影響指定新版 SDK 的 App。時程與例外一起看。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-23T06:32:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"De1emkijYWQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/De1emkijYWQ","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"現在我叫 AI 工作絕對不打字了。\n\n之前用過很多語音輸入工具，要不就突然給我彈出簡體字，要不就訂閱費不便宜，乾脆自己做一個。自己用了兩三個月，不斷根據跟 Agent 的使用習慣去優化，還不完美，但以全本地運算來說已經很堪用了！\n\nEasyType：按住 Fn 講話，放開就輸入繁體中文，任何 App 都能用。語音全部在你的 Mac 上處理。\n\n目前公測中，所有功能免費、字數無上限。\n需要 Apple Silicon Mac、macOS 14 以上。\n\n用起來哪裡不順、哪裡聽錯，歡迎都多多回饋給我，讓我做得更好唷～🙏\n\n連結在底下～","timestamp":"2026-10-23T11:43:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":47,"replies":10,"reposts":0,"shares":33},"score":67,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De1enNCDQFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/De1enNCDQFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"👉 easytype.dev","timestamp":"2026-10-23T11:43:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":7},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"De3aftZEc4x","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De3aftZEc4x","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 真的嫌自己還不夠複雜欸！\n之前把 CLI 跟 IDE 都改成 Antigravity 後\n\n現在 Google 又釋出一個 Preview 的 CLI 庫\n要不要猜猜看它叫什麼 ： gemini-api-cli\n\n功能上其實很不錯\n目前只開放使用 API Key \n可以用來產生\n\n- 基本 AI 問答 (flash 等模型)\n- 影片 (omni)\n- 圖片 (banana)\n- 音樂 (lyria)\n- 文字轉語音 (tts)\n\n簡單來說就是把平常需要用 Gemini 網頁才能做的影片圖片音樂\n可以讓 Claude 直接自由發揮 ( 但會產生對應 API 費用\n\nGoogle AI Pro 以上方案每月有 10 美金的 GCP 抵免額\n也能用在折抵這些 API 花費，沒有在用的人剛好可以參考","timestamp":"2026-10-24T05:46:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":11,"reposts":1,"shares":14},"score":45,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T15:48:13+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De0r2tEEZc4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De0r2tEEZc4","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Grok Bot 的教學文章\n那肯定要請 Grok Bot 自己來寫的\n\n把 10 月最近的更新加入\n和 8 月一開始的舊資訊做清理\n\n在 Grok Bot 做完測試後\n請他自己開這篇文章來更新\n有一種請他自己介紹自己的感覺","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:20:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":24,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De0sucrkbTY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De0sucrkbTY","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"short.darrelltw.com/grok…","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:27:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DezFTz0D26H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DezFTz0D26H","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Final Call\n\nClaude 的最後 reset 時間剩下不到三個小時\n請還沒重設的人盡早記得使用","timestamp":"2026-10-22T13:25:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":8,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":29,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Deyynwjn_rr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Deyynwjn_rr","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"SafeGuard 真的太煩了吧\n\n想用 AI 深度理解一下這次 PHP 的漏洞到底在哪\n結果 prompt 只要出現這些字眼\n\n就直接 Cyber safeguard 擋掉\n更扯的有一次連 Opus 都 Flag 也擋","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:40:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":23,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeyVAM8kQ0y","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DeyVAM8kQ0y","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"報名連結：\nportaly.cc/billy…","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:22:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DeyU_Zekcyv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DeyU_Zekcyv","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"你會看電子書嗎？\n如果會\n那你對怎麼寫一本電子書有興趣嗎？\n\n@billy_nien 準備要在 10/31 辦一場\n實體的電子書工作坊\n\n我自己有興趣的部分就是格式跟排版\n例如有些付費的知識內容 ( 曼報 Pro )\n就會想要嘗試轉成電子書格式，讓我可以在閱讀器上瀏覽\n\n雖然早就轉成功了\n但如果更理解裡面的格式排版規則\n我相信未來可以轉出更順眼的版面\n\n如果你也對怎麼做電子書有興趣\n歡迎參考留言連結 👇","timestamp":"2026-10-22T06:21:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":17,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"De3v6jLm_F_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/De3v6jLm_F_","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"我整理了一份「不是大公司也能申請」的 SaaS 新創額度。\n​\n官網上那些大數字，像「最高 35 萬美元」，幾乎都要有創投或加速器推薦。\n沒募資的一人公司，實際拿得到的是 1 萬美元這個等級。\n​\n不過一年 1 萬美元的伺服器額度，對剛上線的 App 已經很夠用了。\n​\n這次整理了 4 家可以申請的方案：\n◼ Cloudflare\n◼ PostHog\n◼ Mixpanel\n◼ ElevenLabs\n​\n產品還沒上線的話，也附上可以先撐著用的免費方案。\n​\n收藏起來，或分享給正在做產品的朋友 ✨\n​\n金額為 2026 年 10 月官網資料，申請前以官網為準。","timestamp":"2026-10-24T08:53:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":76,"replies":2,"reposts":14,"shares":134},"score":122,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T21:07:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DeycBq3m5Ul","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DeycBq3m5Ul","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"我把我的工作拆成 12 格，\nAI 已經拿走藍色這 3 格：發貼文、跑數據、分類業配信。\n​\n這是照 Anthropic 經濟學家的研究拆的：\n不問哪個職業會消失，而是把工作看成一包任務，\n一格一格看 AI 會讓它不變、輔助、自動化，還是長出新任務。\n​\n工作被拆不是第一次，手寫病歷、電話訂貨早就被上一波科技拆過。\n​\n我自己的看法是：新長出來的格子都在審核 AI，要看得出 AI 哪裡錯，得先自己做過那一格。","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:23:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dex6nZbFCe7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/Dex6nZbFCe7","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"最近脆上都是Grok! 看起來真的很好用\n今天看到Claude終於也要出了！Btw我有用到Muse覺得超好用，而且額度超多，目前有點離不開😆\n\n我還叫他穿Y2K的衣服，他設計了好幾款😆到底最後會選誰呢","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:31:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":61,"replies":33,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":130,"first_seen":"2026-10-24T01:38:04+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}